---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Terms & Conditions - Attendance 75 Calculator"
	description="Terms and conditions for using Attendance 75 Calculator. Free attendance tracking tool for college students."
	keywords="terms and conditions, terms of service, attendance calculator"
>
	<div class="page-container">
		<div class="content-wrapper">
			<!-- Top Bar with Brand Badge & Theme Toggle -->
			<nav class="top-nav">
				<div class="inline-badge">
					<span class="badge-dot"></span>
					<a href="/" class="badge-link">Attendance 75 Calculator</a>
				</div>

				<!-- Theme Toggle Button -->
				<button type="button" id="theme-toggle" class="theme-toggle-btn" aria-label="Toggle Dark/Light Mode" title="Toggle Theme">
					<span id="theme-icon" class="theme-icon">🌙</span>
					<span id="theme-label" class="theme-label">Dark</span>
				</button>
			</nav>

			<!-- Header -->
			<header class="text-center mb-6">
				<h1 class="page-title">Terms & Conditions</h1>
				<p class="page-subtitle">Last Updated: August 31, 2026</p>
			</header>

			<!-- Main Content -->
			<main class="legal-card">
				<section class="legal-section">
					<h2 class="legal-h2">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
					<p>
						By accessing and using Attendance 75 Calculator ("the Service"), you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the Service.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="legal-section">
					<h2 class="legal-h2">2. Description of Service</h2>
					<p>
						Attendance 75 Calculator is a free, client-side web-based tool designed to help college and university students calculate their attendance percentage, determine safe bunk limits, and plan attendance recovery strategies. All calculations are performed locally in your browser.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="legal-section">
					<h2 class="legal-h2">3. User Responsibilities</h2>
					<p>
						As a user of this Service, you agree to:
					</p>
					<ul class="legal-list">
						<li><strong>Accuracy:</strong> Verify all calculation results independently. While we strive for accuracy, you are responsible for confirming that the results match your institution's attendance policies.</li>
						<li><strong>Compliance:</strong> Follow your educational institution's attendance policies, rules, and regulations. This calculator is a planning tool and does not override institutional requirements.</li>
						<li><strong>Appropriate Use:</strong> Use the Service for lawful, educational purposes only. Do not attempt to misuse, hack, or disrupt the Service.</li>
						<li><strong>No Reliance:</strong> Understand that this tool is for informational and educational purposes. Final attendance decisions rest with your institution.</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="legal-section">
					<h2 class="legal-h2">4. No Warranties or Guarantees</h2>
					<p>
						The Service is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to:
					</p>
					<ul class="legal-list">
						<li>Accuracy, reliability, or completeness of calculations</li>
						<li>Uninterrupted or error-free operation</li>
						<li>Fitness for a particular purpose</li>
						<li>Compatibility with your institution's specific attendance policies</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						We do not guarantee that the Service will meet your requirements or that calculation results will be accurate in all scenarios. Different institutions may have unique rounding rules, condonation policies, or calculation methods.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="legal-section">
					<h2 class="legal-h2">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
					<p>
						To the fullest extent permitted by law, Attendance 75 Calculator, its creators, operators, and affiliates shall not be liable for any:
					</p>
					<ul class="legal-list">
						<li>Direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages</li>
						<li>Loss of attendance, examination debarment, academic penalties, or financial losses</li>
						<li>Damages resulting from reliance on calculation results</li>
						<li>Errors, inaccuracies, or omissions in the Service</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						You acknowledge that you use this Service at your own risk and that you are solely responsible for managing your attendance and complying with institutional requirements.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="legal-section">
					<h2 class="legal-h2">6. No Professional Advice</h2>
					<p>
						This Service does not provide academic, legal, or professional advice. The calculations and suggestions provided are for informational purposes only. For official attendance status, condonation options, or policy clarifications, always consult your institution's academic office or registrar.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="legal-section">
					<h2 class="legal-h2">7. Intellectual Property</h2>
					<p>
						All content, design, code, graphics, and materials on this Service are the property of Attendance 75 Calculator and are protected by copyright and intellectual property laws. You may use the Service for personal, non-commercial purposes only.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="legal-section">
					<h2 class="legal-h2">8. Third-Party Links</h2>
					<p>
						The Service may contain links to third-party websites or resources. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of third-party sites. Accessing third-party links is at your own risk.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="legal-section">
					<h2 class="legal-h2">9. Modifications to the Service</h2>
					<p>
						We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue the Service (or any part thereof) at any time without notice. We may also update these Terms and Conditions periodically. Continued use of the Service after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="legal-section">
					<h2 class="legal-h2">10. Termination</h2>
					<p>
						We reserve the right to terminate or restrict your access to the Service at any time, without notice, for any reason, including violation of these Terms and Conditions.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="legal-section">
					<h2 class="legal-h2">11. Governing Law</h2>
					<p>
						These Terms and Conditions shall be governed by and construed in accordance with applicable laws. Any disputes arising from the use of this Service shall be resolved in the appropriate jurisdiction.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="legal-section">
					<h2 class="legal-h2">12. Contact Information</h2>
					<p>
						If you have questions about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us through our <a href="/contact-us" class="legal-link">Contact Us</a> page.
					</p>
				</section>

				<div class="back-home-section">
					<a href="/" class="btn-back-home">← Back to Calculator</a>
				</div>
			</main>

			<!-- Footer -->
			<footer class="footer text-center">
				<nav class="footer-nav">
					<a href="/about-us" class="footer-link">About Us</a>
					<span class="footer-separator">•</span>
					<a href="/privacy-policy" class="footer-link">Privacy Policy</a>
					<span class="footer-separator">•</span>
					<a href="/terms-and-conditions" class="footer-link">Terms & Conditions</a>
					<span class="footer-separator">•</span>
					<a href="/contact-us" class="footer-link">Contact Us</a>
				</nav>
				<p class="footer-note">
					© {new Date().getFullYear()} Attendance 75 Calculator • Free Online College Attendance Tracker
				</p>
			</footer>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	/* Inherit theme variables from main page */
	:root {
		--bg-canvas: #fafafa;
		--bg-card: #ffffff;
		--bg-subtle: #fafafa;
		--text-ink: #171717;
		--text-body: #4d4d4d;
		--text-muted: #8f8f8f;
		--border-hairline: #ebebeb;
		--border-focus: #171717;
		--shadow-card: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
		--link-color: #0070f3;
		--link-hover: #0051cc;
	}

	html.dark {
		--bg-canvas: #0a0a0a;
		--bg-card: #121212;
		--bg-subtle: #171717;
		--text-ink: #ededed;
		--text-body: #a1a1a1;
		--text-muted: #707070;
		--border-hairline: #262626;
		--border-focus: #ffffff;
		--shadow-card: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
		--link-color: #52a8ff;
		--link-hover: #80c0ff;
	}

	.page-container {
		min-height: 100vh;
		background-color: var(--bg-canvas);
		color: var(--text-ink);
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 28px 16px;
		font-family: 'Geist', Arial, sans-serif;
		box-sizing: border-box;
		transition: background-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.content-wrapper {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 740px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.top-nav {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		margin-bottom: 20px;
	}

	.inline-badge {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 6px;
		padding: 5px 12px;
		background: var(--bg-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
		border-radius: 100px;
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--text-body);
		box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
	}

	.badge-dot {
		width: 6px;
		height: 6px;
		background-color: #00c851;
		border-radius: 50%;
	}

	.badge-link {
		color: var(--text-body);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.15s ease;
	}

	.badge-link:hover {
		color: var(--text-ink);
	}

	.theme-toggle-btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 6px;
		padding: 5px 12px;
		background: var(--bg-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
		border-radius: 100px;
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--text-ink);
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: all 0.15s ease;
		font-family: inherit;
	}

	.theme-toggle-btn:hover {
		background: var(--bg-subtle);
		border-color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.theme-icon {
		font-size: 14px;
		line-height: 1;
	}

	.theme-label {
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.page-title {
		font-size: 32px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--text-ink);
		margin: 6px 0;
		letter-spacing: -0.8px;
		line-height: 1.2;
	}

	.page-subtitle {
		font-size: 14px;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin: 4px 0;
	}

	.legal-card {
		background: var(--bg-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
		border-radius: 16px;
		padding: 32px 28px;
		margin-bottom: 24px;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
		transition: background-color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.legal-section {
		margin-bottom: 28px;
	}

	.legal-section:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.legal-h2 {
		font-size: 20px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--text-ink);
		margin: 0 0 12px 0;
		letter-spacing: -0.4px;
	}

	.legal-card p {
		font-size: 14px;
		color: var(--text-body);
		line-height: 1.65;
		margin: 0 0 12px 0;
	}

	.legal-card p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.legal-list {
		margin: 10px 0 14px 20px;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: disc;
	}

	.legal-list li {
		font-size: 14px;
		color: var(--text-body);
		line-height: 1.65;
		margin-bottom: 8px;
	}

	.legal-link {
		color: var(--link-color);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.15s ease;
	}

	.legal-link:hover {
		color: var(--link-hover);
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.back-home-section {
		margin-top: 32px;
		padding-top: 24px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.btn-back-home {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 6px;
		padding: 10px 18px;
		background: var(--bg-subtle);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
		border-radius: 8px;
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--text-ink);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: all 0.15s ease;
	}

	.btn-back-home:hover {
		background: var(--bg-canvas);
		border-color: var(--border-focus);
	}

	.footer {
		padding: 12px 0 24px 0;
	}

	.footer-nav {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 8px;
		margin-bottom: 12px;
	}

	.footer-link {
		font-size: 13px;
		color: var(--text-body);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.15s ease;
	}

	.footer-link:hover {
		color: var(--text-ink);
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.footer-separator {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 13px;
	}

	.footer-note {
		font-size: 12px;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.page-container {
			padding: 16px 12px;
		}

		.page-title {
			font-size: 26px;
		}

		.legal-card {
			padding: 24px 20px;
		}

		.legal-h2 {
			font-size: 18px;
		}

		.footer-nav {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 6px;
		}

		.footer-separator {
			display: none;
		}
	}
</style>

<script>
	// Theme toggle logic
	const themeToggleBtn = document.getElementById('theme-toggle');
	const themeIcon = document.getElementById('theme-icon');
	const themeLabel = document.getElementById('theme-label');

	function updateThemeUI(isDark: boolean) {
		if (themeIcon && themeLabel) {
			if (isDark) {
				themeIcon.textContent = '☀️';
				themeLabel.textContent = 'Light';
			} else {
				themeIcon.textContent = '🌙';
				themeLabel.textContent = 'Dark';
			}
		}
	}

	const isInitiallyDark = document.documentElement.classList.contains('dark');
	updateThemeUI(isInitiallyDark);

	themeToggleBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
		const isCurrentlyDark = document.documentElement.classList.contains('dark');
		const newThemeIsDark = !isCurrentlyDark;

		if (newThemeIsDark) {
			document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');
			localStorage.setItem('theme', 'dark');
		} else {
			document.documentElement.classList.remove('dark');
			localStorage.setItem('theme', 'light');
		}

		updateThemeUI(newThemeIsDark);
	});
</script>
